       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. G14MAIN.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-X PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "MAIN-BEFORE-CALL".
           ADD 5 TO WS-X.
           CALL "G14SUB".
           DISPLAY "MAIN-AFTER-CALL X=" WS-X.
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM G14MAIN.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. G14SUB.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           DISPLAY "SUB-RAN-NO-PARA-NAME".
       END PROGRAM G14SUB.
